The estimation methods can be classified with different categories based on two criteria:
\begin{itemize}
	\item[\ding{172}] time-domain methods and spectrum-domain methods based on the representation of TS;
	\item[\ding{173}] linear regression methods and Bayesian methods based on the parameter estimation method.
\end{itemize}

