Thus, based on the properties of the resultant polynomial, we have:  $$\parallel G \parallel _ {\infty} = \max \left\{  \left \{1, \, r^2, \,  \sqrt{X_1}, \, \sqrt{X_2} \right \} \cup \bigg( \pi_{\gamma}(\Sigma) \cup \Sigma_{\infty} \bigg) \right\}.$$
