\item For $\gamma=r^2$: ${\rm Lc}_{\omega}(n)=(\gamma^2-r^4)=0$, i.e, $r^2 \in \Sigma_{\infty}$.
\item For $\gamma=1$, we get:
\[
 \left \{
    \begin{array}{ll}
