    \includegraphics[width=\textwidth]{figures/node_based.jpg}
    \caption{An example of the node-based implementation of the 3-Seq operation. To illustrate the differences between node-based and route-based implementations, we reuse the same setting as in Figure \ref{fig:ext_3_seq}. In this example, five nodes are distributed across two routes: the 2nd, 3rd, and 6th nodes on route $R_1$, and the 3rd and 5th nodes on route $R_2$. The figure shows how the head, middle, and tail sequences are extracted based on node positions, and highlights their relationship to those obtained through the route-based method.}
