            \sum_{i=1}^{n}\Dfrac{\rho(X_i\vert X_{< i}Y_{>i}M)}{\rho(X_i)} &= \sum_{i=1}^n\E_{\rho(xym)}\Bigg[\log \frac{\rho(x_i \vert x_{< i}y_{> i}m)}{\rho(x_i)}\bigg]\\
