The continued growth in the NRP user community lead to the implementation of a richer set of policies. This includes a resource allocation mechanism for the most heavily in demand GPUs, an Acceptable Use Policy, and enhancements to security, monitoring, and their automation, as detailed in Section \ref{sec:security}. Overall, the NRP continues to grow in both users and resources, while providing innovative offerings such as hosted LLMs\footnote{Including those that provided assistance in editing this paper!} and other shared services.

