\subsection{Computational Resources}

As of Spring 2025, the NRP comprises in excess of 1,400 GPUs, 28,000 CPUs, and 161 TB of RAM distributed across more than 420 nodes. The GPU models available vary considerably, ranging from the older NVIDIA RTX 2080 Ti to the state-of-the-art Grace Hopper H200, with numerous intermediate models. Users can specify preferred GPU models or provide a list of acceptable GPUs. The Kubernetes scheduler then allocates resources accordingly.

