    \caption{Overall synthetic evaluation results. Solid lines represent mean values and shaded regions the 95\% intervals, calculated from the set of approximately 3400 observations for each rate step. We can confirm that all models exhibit similar sensitivity to prompt augmentations, with Keyboard Typos being a more invasive augmentation method. Gemini 2.0  Flash is the most robust to synonym augmentation, while sensitivity of all models to typos is approximately the same.}
