The goal of our evaluation is to demonstrate the energy-aware programming capabilities of LASSI-EE while also uncovering key lessons learned throughout the process. We assess LASSI-EE using 20  parallel codes executed on a target system, examining both the quantity of generated codes that yield observable energy savings and the extent of those improvements. 
