\subsubsection{Code Compilation.}
Multiple stages of the LASSI-EE pipeline require local, on-demand file access to the source or refactored code to evaluate function and performance. Each code in this experiment was compiled in the same compute environment with \verb|nvcc|. The same compiler flags applied in all experimental runs so that each generated code result was benefited from identical baseline compiler optimizations:

