		$\rho: (q_0, \nu_0)\xrightarrow{P_i, \gamma_i/ L_i, Z_i}\dots \xrightarrow{P_j, \gamma_j / L_j, Z_j} (q_f, \nu_f)$ and $q_f\in F$. Then, $(i, j, \mu)\in \semaux{\cT_{\varphi}}(\Stream)$.

