\section{Methods}

\subsection{Language classification}

For language classification, a ResNet34~\cite{he16_resnet} was trained on VoxLingua107 \cite{valk21_voxlingua} using cross-entropy loss. The model was used to analyze the distribution of languages spoken in the VoxCeleb1 and 2 datasets \cite{nagrani17_interspeech, chung18b_interspeech} which served as training data for the speaker verification models (see Fig. \ref{fig:voxceleb_languages}).

