\begin{definition}
  A \gls{cidm} channel comprises in succession of a pure delay shifter, a
  cancellation unit, a Boolean gate, a pure-delay unit, a shaping unit and a
  thresholding unit [see \cref{fig:channel_model_idm2gidm}(c)].
\end{definition}
