\subsubsection{Next POI Recommendation}
\label{sec:NEXTPOIREC}

The table demonstrates GOT's consistent superiority over baseline models, excelling in synthesizing contextual and sequential information for next POI recommendations. AdaptGOT achieves the highest recall scores, particularly in dense, multi-context environments like New York, where it improves Rec@5 by 23.8\% over SpaBERT under FPMC and 15.5\% under GETNEXT. In Los Angeles, GOT shows a 48.3\% Rec@5 improvement over CTLE under FPMC and 36.5\% over SpaBERT. AdaptGOT also leads in tasks like LSTPM and HST, achieving substantial gains such as 33.3\% in Rec@10 over CTLE under LSTPM. In contrast, models like SpaBERT and CTLE fall short in capturing fine-grained contextual information. 

