Annotators were compensated at a rate of 17 CAD per hour through UpWork. To encourage steady progress, a weekly bonus of 10 USD was provided to those who completed at least half of their assignments by midweek. An additional performance-based bonus of 150 USD was awarded to annotators who produced the highest-quality annotations. The total cost of the \textsc{MoMentS} main annotation effort amounted to 8,745 USD.

