\subsubsection{Cross-Dataset Evaluation}

We validated our proposed DRA on the Cross-Datasets Evaluation benchmark, and the results are shown in Table \ref{tab:cross}. The model is first fine-tuned on ImageNet and directly tested on 10 target datasets. Our DRA achieves the highest average precision compared with the state-of-the-art methods. Specifically, DRA outperforms CoCoOp over 9/10 datasets. Compared to MaPLe, the proposed DRA leads in 8/10 datasets, while it outperforms TCP and MMA in 7/10 datasets. In addition, DRA achieves competitive results on ImageNet, outperforming other methods except CoOp. These results demonstrate the advantage of our method in zero-shot transfer capability in various downstream tasks.

